---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Work | Mohamed Meghawry"
  description="IT support, operations coordination, and automation engineering across York University, Lassonde School of Engineering, and Maple Arts."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Work</h1>

  <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">Operational IT work, automation, and platform administration.</p>

  <section class="mt-12 space-y-12">
    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        IT and Operations Coordinator
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">The Canadian Arabic Orchestra (Maple Arts) · Jul 2023 to present</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Built a bilingual customer service automation system with JavaScript, Make.com, and WhatsApp Business API. Cut response times to under 60 seconds and automated 80% of inquiries.</li>
        <li>Administer 8 WordPress sites and the associated MailChimp, TextMagic, and Meta business integrations.</li>
        <li>Building a cross-platform events app for iOS and Android with React Native, TypeScript, and Firebase; live event listings, push notifications, in-app ticket booking, and an audio player. Now in TestFlight beta ahead of app store launch.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Technical Support Specialist
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Lassonde School of Engineering, York University · May 2022 to Jun 2023</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Provided technical support and mentorship to over 100 Computer Science students in Java, C, Bash, and JavaScript.</li>
        <li>Managed ticketing queues for students and faculty, prioritizing by severity.</li>
        <li>Maintained two engineering department websites.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Help Desk Specialist
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">York University · Jan 2022 to May 2022</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Diagnosed and resolved hardware, software, and network issues in person and remotely.</li>
        <li>Managed accounts and access via Active Directory and university identity systems.</li>
        <li>Supported Windows and macOS environments end to end.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
